@startuml
' Developer dev loop — PlantUML sequence + component
actor Developer
node "Dev Machine" as Local
cloud "GitHub" as GH
participant "CI Runner" as CI
database "Artifacts" as Artifacts
participant "Node App" as Node
participant "Python myai" as Py

Developer -> Local: edit code, run unit tests
Local -> Node: npm run dev (hot-reload)
Local -> Py: start myai (uvicorn)
Developer -> GH: push branch / open PR
GH -> CI: trigger pipeline (PR checks)
CI -> Node: npm ci && npm run build
CI -> Node: npm run test:fast (unit tests)
CI -> Py: run myai integration tests
alt All checks pass
  CI -> GH: report success
  GH -> CI: trigger deploy workflow
  CI -> Artifacts: publish build
  CI -> Node: deploy / start-full
  CI -> GH: report deployed (smoke ok)
else Any check fails
  CI -> GH: report failure
  GH -> Developer: notify failing checks
end

note left of CI
  Best practice: split lint/unit/integration
  Use caching for node_modules and build artifacts
end note
@enduml
